; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5301  ** Reentrancy      : Reentrant for different channels                         **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5302  **                                                                            **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5303  ** Parameters (in) : Channel - Channel ID of the respective EB channel        **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5304  **                   SrcDataBufferPtr - This is the pointer to source buffer  **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5305  **                                               for the EB channel           **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5306  **                   DesDataBufferPtr - This is the pointer to destination    **
