; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5311  **                            2 * 8-bit = 16 bits will be transferred,        **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5312  **                            for 16-bit channel, if length is 2, then        **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5313  **                            2 * 16-bit = 32 bits will be transferred and    **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5314  **                            for 32-bit channel, if length is 2, then        **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5315  **                            2 * 32-bit = 64 bits will be transferred        **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5316  **                                                                            **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5317  ** Parameters (out): None                                                     **
