; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5319  ** Return value    : E_OK - Buffers has been setup for the EB channel         **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5320  **                   E_NOT_OK - Buffer setup for the channel has not          **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5321  **                                                     been accepted          **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5322  **                                                                            **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5323  ** Description     : This API initializes the buffers and transfer length     **
