; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5326  **        i.e., If Source address is NULL, then transfer default configured   **
; ..\MCAL364\Spi\ssc\src\Spi.c	  5327  **              If Destination address is NULL, then ignore the received data **
